# Secrets live in environment variables only — scripts read os.environ and do
# NOT load .env files (by design, see README «Безопасность»).
#
# Export in your shell before real runs:
#   export FAL_KEY="..."
#
# .env / *.key / *.pem are git-ignored and blocked from the agent by the
# PreToolUse hook (.zcode/config.json). This file is safe to commit.
